{
  "body": "<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">skip to content</a>\n<header class=\"site-header\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><svg class=\"brand-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 29.9618 32.9579\" width=\"32\" height=\"35\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 15.4803H10.4866V22.4713H19.4751V15.4803H29.9618V32.9579H0V15.4803Z\" fill=\"#101112\" /><g class=\"header-spark\"><path d=\"M13.9822 0L23.9694 4.49428L19.4751 14.4815L9.48789 9.98725L13.9822 0Z\" fill=\"#E42321\" /></g></svg></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a href=\"#local\">KilnOS</a><a href=\"/products/one/\">Explore Kiln One</a><a href=\"/about\">about</a><button class=\"nav-contact enquiry-open\">contact</button></nav><button class=\"header-cta enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"KilnOS pilot\">Request a pilot <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><button class=\"menu-toggle\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><span class=\"menu-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button></header>\n<nav class=\"mobile-menu\" id=\"mobile-menu\" aria-label=\"Main menu\" hidden><div class=\"menu-links\"><a href=\"#local\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>KilnOS<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span></a><a href=\"/products/one/\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Explore Kiln One<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span></a><a href=\"/about\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>about<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span></a><button class=\"menu-contact enquiry-open\"><span class=\"menu-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>contact<span class=\"menu-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span></button></div><div class=\"menu-bottom\"><button class=\"action primary enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"KilnOS pilot\">Request a pilot <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/hardware\">explore the hardware <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></nav>\n<main id=\"main\" class=\"software-home\">\n<section class=\"software-hero\" id=\"top\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\">\n<div class=\"software-hero-copy\"><p class=\"meta software-kicker\"><span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> KilnOS / a first look</p>\n<h1 id=\"hero-title\">One place to make an ad</h1>\n<p class=\"software-subhead\">AI software for creative agencies. Starting with video revisions.</p>\n<div class=\"software-cta\"><button class=\"action primary enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"KilnOS pilot\">Request a pilot <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><p>No Kiln hardware required.</p></div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"workflow-hero\"><div class=\"workflow-label\"><span>KilnOS</span><span>Prototype visual</span></div><a href=\"/assets/kiln/kilnos-cut-prototype.webp\" aria-label=\"View the KilnOS editing prototype at full size\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln/kilnos-cut-prototype.webp\" width=\"2367\" height=\"1361\" alt=\"KilnOS editing prototype showing a client note, a proposed revision and a film timeline with an audio track.\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a><figcaption>Direct the cut.<span>Interface concept, not a live product.</span></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"software-membership\"><a class=\"inception-membership\" href=\"https://www.nvidia.com/en-gb/startups/\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln/nvidia-inception.png\" width=\"1168\" height=\"404\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"><span>Proud to be part of NVIDIA Inception.</span></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section revision-story\" id=\"local\" aria-labelledby=\"revision-title\"><span id=\"kilnos\" class=\"anchor-alias\"></span><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">01 / the first workflow</span><span class=\"meta\">proposed pilot scope</span></div>\n<div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"revision-title\">One note.<br>The next cut.</h2><p>“Change this shot.<br>Keep everything else.”</p></div>\n<ol class=\"revision-steps\"><li><span class=\"meta\">01 / client feedback</span><h3>Pick the shot.</h3><p>Bring the client’s note into the cut. Choose the shot to revise.</p></li><li><span class=\"meta\">02 / a focused revision</span><h3>Keep the rest.</h3><p>Change that shot. Leave the other shots and audio untouched.</p></li><li><span class=\"meta\">03 / back for review</span><h3>Send for approval.</h3><p>Review the change, then send the revised cut for client sign-off.</p></li></ol>\n<p class=\"software-boundary\">This is the workflow we want to test with agencies. Pilot scope and supported models are agreed together.</p></section>\n<section class=\"section agency-workspace\" id=\"privacy\" aria-labelledby=\"workspace-title\"><div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"meta\">02 / built around the brief</span><span class=\"meta\">the KilnOS direction</span></div><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 id=\"workspace-title\">The work.<br>All together.</h2><p>An AI-native creative operating system. Your brief, assets, models and decisions in one place.</p></div><div class=\"agency-principles\"><article><h3>The right models.</h3><p>Work with models approved for the brief, with licensing and suitability reviewed for the pilot.</p></article><article><h3>Your client’s assets.</h3><p>Agree who can access the work and where it can go before a project starts.</p></article><article><h3>A cut to sign off.</h3><p>Keep the revision focused and the next approval clear.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"section one-teaser\" id=\"hardware\" aria-labelledby=\"one-teaser-title\"><div><p class=\"meta\">03 / a future studio option</p><h2 id=\"one-teaser-title\">Meet Kiln One.</h2><p>Dedicated local compute for studios that want their own machine. A future option, separate from the initial KilnOS pilot.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/products/one/\">Explore Kiln One <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><p class=\"fine\">Hardware concept. Engineering targets remain unvalidated.</p></div><a href=\"/products/one/\" aria-label=\"Explore Kiln One\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln/finishes/charcoal-960.webp\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" alt=\"Deep charcoal Kiln One workstation concept with a leather handle.\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section>\n<section class=\"section faq software-faq\" id=\"questions\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\"><div class=\"faq-layout\"><h2 id=\"faq-title\">A little more.</h2><div><details><summary>What can we pilot?</summary><p>A focused video-revision workflow: take client feedback, change one shot while preserving the rest, then prepare the revised cut for approval. Tell us about your brief so we can agree scope, supported models and what to evaluate.</p></details><details><summary>Do we need Kiln One?</summary><p>No Kiln hardware is required for the initial KilnOS pilot. Kiln One is a future option for dedicated local compute.</p></details><details><summary>Can we use KilnOS today?</summary><p>KilnOS is in development, with pilots arranged through direct conversations. Request a pilot to discuss fit and scope. The visuals show a prototype, not generally available software.</p></details></div></div></section>\n<!-- team section -->\n<section class=\"section software-invitation\" id=\"interest\"><span id=\"software-pricing\" class=\"anchor-alias\"></span><span id=\"studio-service\" class=\"anchor-alias\"></span><p class=\"meta\">Start with a real brief</p><h2>Bring the next cut.</h2><p>Tell us what needs to change.</p><button class=\"action primary enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"KilnOS pilot\">Request a pilot <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button><p class=\"fine\">No Kiln hardware required. Pilot terms agreed together.</p><noscript><p><a href=\"/book/\">Book a call</a> or <a href=\"mailto:richard@portolabs.xyz\">email the Kiln team</a> to discuss a pilot.</p></noscript></section>\n</main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"footer-main\"><a href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"Kiln home\"><img src=\"/assets/kiln/kiln-crucible-light.svg\" width=\"42\" height=\"46\" alt=\"Kiln\"></a><p>One place.<br>For the next cut.</p><nav aria-label=\"Footer\"><a href=\"/about\">about Kiln</a><a href=\"#team\">team</a><a href=\"/products/one/\">Explore Kiln One</a><a href=\"#questions\">questions</a><a href=\"#privacy\">our privacy direction</a><a href=\"/privacy\">website privacy</a><button class=\"footer-contact enquiry-open\">contact us ↗</button></nav></div><div class=\"footer-bottom\"><span>© Kiln 2026 / Porto Labs</span><span>Hardware and software in development.</span><a href=\"#top\">back to top ↑</a></div></footer>\n<button class=\"mobile-dock enquiry-open\" data-interest=\"KilnOS pilot\">Request a pilot <span class=\"square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></button>\n<dialog id=\"register-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"register-title\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close registration\">×</button><h2 id=\"register-title\">Keep in<br>touch.</h2><p>Product news and launch updates.</p><form action=\"https://formspree.io/f/xjgepgbg\" method=\"POST\" class=\"enquiry-form\" data-enquiry-kind=\"interest\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-email\">email</label><input id=\"register-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" maxlength=\"254\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@studio.com\" required></div><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"register-product\">interested in <span>(optional)</span></label><select id=\"register-product\" name=\"product\"><option>Still exploring</option><option>Kiln One</option><option>Media</option><option>Legal</option><option>Investor interest</option></select></div><label class=\"consent\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"consent\" required><span>Email me Kiln updates.</span></label><div class=\"form-trap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><label>leave this empty<input name=\"website\" type=\"text\" tabindex=\"-1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></label></div><p class=\"form-note\">Unsubscribe anytime. <